<h2 id="lift2">LIFT2</h2>
<p>The BriGap-2 workshop is funded by <a href="https://gdr-lift.loria.fr/">RT LIFT2</a>, a France-based research group aiming to bring together researchers in computational linguistics, formal linguistics, and field linguistics around shared questions, data, and tools.</p>

<p>More on the <a href="/2025/about.html">About page</a>.</p>


